      "created_at": "2014-11-02T23:44:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Any of the sideways target cards that have the word Device on them are Baron Blades turrets.</p><p>Turret Installation says put a device marker in play.</p><p>They are also mentioned in the&nbsp;<em>Continuing the Story</em> section of the scenario rules by name.</p>",
